  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "よくぼうと　のうりょくを　ひきだすどくその　もちを　たべさせて　たべたあいてを　くさりで　あやつるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "욕망과 능력을 끌어올리는 독소로 된 떡을 먹이고 먹은 상대를 사슬로 조종한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會讓對手吃下能激發慾望與能力的毒素麻糬，然後用鎖鏈來操控對手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait manger à sa cible un mochi empoisonné qui éveille les désirs et révèle le potentiel. Il la contrôle ensuite grâce à ses chaînes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es gibt anderen giftige Mochi zu essen, die Kräfte und Begierden wecken, kettet sie so an sich und kontrolliert sie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hace comer a su objetivo un mochi tóxico que saca a relucir todo su potencial y su ambición, para después controlarlo con sus cadenas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fa mangiare alle sue vittime dei mochi tossici che ne risvegliano il potenziale e i desideri, per poi controllarle con una catena.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It feeds others toxic mochi that draw out desires and capabilities. Those who eat the mochi fall under Pecharunt’s control, chained to its will.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "欲望と　能力を　引き出す毒素の　餅を　食べさせて　食べた相手を　鎖で　操るのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会让对手吃下能提升欲望和能力的毒粘糕，然后通过锁链控制对手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hace comer a su objetivo un mochi tóxico que saca a relucir todo su potencial y su ambición, para después controlarlo con sus cadenas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "モモがたの　からは　もうどくのちょぞうこ。　どくの　もちを　つくりひとや　ポケモンに　ふるまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "복숭아처럼 생긴 껍질은 그야말로 맹독의 저장고다. 독이 든 떡을 만들어서 사람과 포켓몬에게 대접한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "桃形的殼是劇毒的儲藏庫。會製作帶毒的麻糬送給人和寶可夢吃。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il conserve du poison dans sa carapace en forme de pêche. Il s’en sert pour préparer des mochis qu’il donne aux êtres humains et aux Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In der wie ein Pfirsich geformten Schale speichert es Gift und stellt daraus giftige Mochi her, die es Menschen und Pokémon anbietet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su caparazón con forma de melocotón alberga un potente veneno con el que prepara un mochi tóxico que ofrece a humanos y Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nel guscio a forma di pesca conserva un potente veleno con cui prepara dei mochi tossici che offre a persone e Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its peach-shaped shell serves as storage for a potent poison. It makes poisonous mochi and serves them to people and Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "モモ型の　殻は　猛毒の貯蔵庫。　毒の　餅を　作り人や　ポケモンに　ふるまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "桃形的壳是剧毒的储存库。会制作毒粘糕来款待人和宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
